docs/data/leaderboard_snapshots/

# Generated artifacts — these are produced by the analytics pipeline and
# deployed to the gh-pages branch on every run. They must NOT be committed to
# the main branch so that Git history does not accumulate redundant versions.
# GitHub Pages is served from the gh-pages branch, so all frontend files
# remain accessible without being stored in main-branch history.

# Visualizations
docs/plots/
docs/tournament-charts/

